---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Glossar
permalink: /glossar/
description: Begriffe rund um regeneratives Wirtschaften kurz erklärt – von Regeneration und Donut-Modell bis Purpose, POSIWID und planetare Grenzen.
eleventyComputed:
  jsonld: >-
    {{ { "@context": "https://schema.org", "@type": "DefinedTermSet", "name": "Glossar regeneratives Wirtschaften", "url": site.url + "/glossar/", "inLanguage": "de", "hasDefinedTerm": glossarGroups.all | glossarLd(site.url) } | dump | safe }}
---
<header class="page-head wrap">
  <span class="label">Glossar · {{ glossarGroups.all.length }} Begriffe</span>
  <h1 class="display">Begriffe rund um regeneratives Wirtschaften.</h1>
  <p class="lead">Kurz erklärt und mit den Beiträgen verknüpft, in denen wir tiefer einsteigen.</p>
</header>

<section class="wrap glossary">
  <nav class="az" aria-label="Alphabetisch springen">
    {%- for g in glossarGroups.groups %}<a href="#buchstabe-{{ g.letter | lower }}">{{ g.letter }}</a>{% endfor %}
  </nav>

  {%- for g in glossarGroups.groups %}
  <div class="gl-group" id="buchstabe-{{ g.letter | lower }}">
    <div class="gl-letter" aria-hidden="true">{{ g.letter }}</div>
    <div class="gl-terms">
      {%- for t in g.terms %}
      <article class="gl-term" id="{{ t.slug }}">
        <h2 class="gl-name"><a href="#{{ t.slug }}">{{ t.term }}</a></h2>
        <p class="gl-short">{{ t.short }}</p>
        <p class="gl-text">{{ t.text }}</p>
        {%- if t.post %}
        {%- for p in collections.posts %}{% if p.fileSlug == t.post %}
        <p class="gl-more"><a class="t-link" href="{{ p.url }}">Im Blog: {{ p.data.title }} <span class="arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></p>
        {%- endif %}{% endfor %}
        {%- endif %}
        {%- if t.relatedLinks.length %}
        <p class="gl-see"><span class="label">Siehe auch</span>{% for r in t.relatedLinks %}<a href="#{{ r.slug }}">{{ r.term }}</a>{% endfor %}</p>
        {%- endif %}
      </article>
      {%- endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
  {%- endfor %}
</section>
{% include "partials/newsletter.njk" %}
